{"id":"blagodarya","lemma":"благодаря","pos":"prep","rank":546,"glosses":["thanks to, owing to, through (by means of), due to"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a3/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Благодаря вам я приехала вовремя.","en":"Thanks to you, I arrived on time.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to arrive, to come","l":"приехать"},{"g":"in time"}]},{"text":"Благодаря ей, её мать счастлива.","en":"She makes her mother happy.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) her"},{"g":"her"},{"g":"mother"},null]},{"text":"Благодаря тебе я хочу стать лучше.","en":"You make me want to be a better person.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to stand"},{"g":"rather, would better )"}]},{"text":"Мы получили его благодаря ей.","en":"We got it thanks to her.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to receive, to get","l":"получить"},{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"(to) her"}]},{"text":"Благодаря ему я мог бы получить работу.","en":"Thanks to him, I could get a job.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) him","l":"он"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"to receive, to get"},null]}]}